---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Interviews">
  <p class="mono-eyebrow mb-1"><span class="text-accent-blue">$</span> speak --verbose</p>
  <h1 class="glitch is-intro mb-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-brand-text" data-text="Interviews">Interviews</h1>
  <p class="mb-8 text-brand-muted">Mix content in English and in French.</p>

  <div class="space-y-10">

    <article class="border-b border-brand-border pb-8">
      <time class="text-sm text-brand-muted">03.04.2025</time>
      <h2 class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-brand-text">Podcast Tronche de Tech – Les failles du web3</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-brand-body">Ethereum, like every blockchain, faces the security, scalability, decentralisation trilemma. Layer-2 "rollups" boost throughput, but they often share the same codebase and language as the chain itself, a single point of failure. In this episode, host Mathieu Sanchez explores how Karolina hunts for that critical flaw every day, before someone else does.</p>
      <div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/44-karolina-gorna-les-failles-dethereum/id1692421892" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sm text-band-fn-pure underline underline-offset-2">Apple Podcast</a>
        <a href="https://dzr.page.link/EmXSqWT3Bg898yy9A" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sm text-band-fn-pure underline underline-offset-2">Deezer</a>
      </div>
      <iframe class="mt-4 aspect-video w-full max-w-2xl rounded-md" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/rXtRXHsgjDo" title="Tronche de Tech – Les failles du web3" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen loading="lazy"></iframe>
      <iframe class="mt-3 w-full max-w-2xl rounded-xl" style="height:152px" src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/episode/6GqAj8MYK2qQuLCI6yCAwF" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen allow="autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" loading="lazy" title="Tronche de Tech – Les failles du web3 (Spotify)"></iframe>
    </article>

    <article class="border-b border-brand-border pb-8">
      <time class="text-sm text-brand-muted">24.03.2025</time>
      <h2 class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-brand-text">Roundtable #2: Security – ft Starknet, Mina, Ledger, Zama, Holonym, Oak Security, Cure53/Symbolic</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-brand-body">Welcome to the second episode of our Blockchain Roundtable series! In this in-depth discussion, speakers from Zama, Ledger, Holonym, Oak Security, and Mina Foundation explore the multifaceted topic of security in the decentralized ecosystem. Our panelists have a discussion about unique challenges, operational security for DAOs, the impact of ZK (Zero-Knowledge) proofs, and potential new attack vectors. The conversation also touches on best practices, formal methods, standardization, and auditing in the Web3 world.</p>
      <iframe class="mt-4 aspect-video w-full max-w-2xl rounded-md" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/K1sRpWZPbxs" title="Roundtable #2: Security" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen loading="lazy"></iframe>
    </article>

    <article class="border-b border-brand-border pb-8">
      <time class="text-sm text-brand-muted">12.04.2024</time>
      <h2 class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-brand-text">Fuzzing vs. Preuves Formelles : Comment sécuriser durablement les smart contracts et les rollups ?</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-brand-body">Panel organisé lors du KRYPTOSPHERE Blockchain Summit 2024, avec l'intervention d'experts de la sécurité : Mathis Gontier Delaunay (Morpho Labs), Patrick Ventuzelo (FuzzingLabs), Guillaume Claret (Formal Land), Karolina Gorna (Ledger).</p>
      <iframe class="mt-4 aspect-video w-full max-w-2xl rounded-md" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/fE4s0G3NFE4" title="Fuzzing vs. Preuves Formelles" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen loading="lazy"></iframe>
    </article>

    <article class="border-b border-brand-border pb-8">
      <time class="text-sm text-brand-muted">10.12.2023</time>
      <h2 class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-brand-text">web3sec portrait n°9</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-brand-body">Today, we'll learn more about @KarolinaGorna_ in web3 security: doing a Ph.D. at @DonjonLedger and former president of the @KRYPTOSPHERE_. This is a series of interviews and portraits about actors in web3 security for @opensensepw.</p>
      <div class="mt-3">
        <a href="https://x.com/0xtotem/status/1733860616928899207?s=20" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sm text-band-fn-pure underline underline-offset-2">Interview on X</a>
      </div>
      <img src="/images/twitter_itw.png" alt="web3sec portrait" class="mt-3 max-w-sm rounded-md border border-brand-border" loading="lazy" />
    </article>

    <article class="border-b border-brand-border pb-8">
      <time class="text-sm text-brand-muted">22.09.2023</time>
      <h2 class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-brand-text">THE LAW OF STAN – Mathematics in Blockchain with Karolina GORNA, Software Security Engineer at Ledger</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-brand-body">In this episode, I delve into the diverse applications of mathematics within the Blockchain and cryptocurrency industry. And what better way to explore this topic than by featuring Karolina Gorna, a software security engineer at the market-leading company "Ledger." We will uncover the specific mathematical facets that underpin this dynamic industry.</p>
      <div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/be/podcast/the-laws-of-stan/id1706738712?i=1000628805280" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sm text-band-fn-pure underline underline-offset-2">Apple Podcast</a>
        <a href="https://www.buzzsprout.com/2245270/13638760" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sm text-band-fn-pure underline underline-offset-2">Buzzsprout</a>
      </div>
      <iframe class="mt-4 w-full max-w-2xl rounded-xl" style="height:152px" src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/episode/6YgBbOVzpe982g17JPSTJV?si=046d75d2ed704b62" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen allow="autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" loading="lazy" title="The Law of Stan – Mathematics in Blockchain"></iframe>
    </article>

    <article class="border-b border-brand-border pb-8">
      <time class="text-sm text-brand-muted">26.06.2023</time>
      <h2 class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-brand-text">Interview Behind The Chain with Romain Millon</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-brand-body">Karolina a toujours travaillé dans le web3, qu'elle a découvert plus précisément en adhérant à l'association étudiante blockchain Kryptosphere. Dans cet épisode, elle nous présente les grandes étapes de son parcours web3.</p>
      <div class="mt-3">
        <a href="https://www.behindthechain.xyz/episodes/episode29btc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sm text-band-fn-pure underline underline-offset-2">Podcast website</a>
      </div>
      <iframe class="mt-4 w-full max-w-2xl rounded-xl" style="height:152px" src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/episode/1MuxW7oDR5eRh5eXnPvOLD?si=cx0mdt00RIasQs5NQg1ZVg" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen allow="autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" loading="lazy" title="Behind The Chain – Karolina Gorna"></iframe>
    </article>

    <article class="border-b border-brand-border pb-8">
      <time class="text-sm text-brand-muted">11.06.2023</time>
      <h2 class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-brand-text">Meetup StarkWare x PyratzLabs</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-brand-body">The highlight of this event is the exclusive round table discussion featuring prominent speakers, including Briyan Cessac (Screenshot Labs), Karolina Gorna (Ledger), and Henri Liuetaud. This engaging discussion revolves around use cases and builders within the StarkWare ecosystem. Moderated by Julien Furlanetto (Doors3).</p>
      <iframe class="mt-4 aspect-video w-full max-w-2xl rounded-md" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/xEryGbFgu-A" title="Meetup StarkWare x PyratzLabs" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen loading="lazy"></iframe>
    </article>

    <article class="border-b border-brand-border pb-8">
      <time class="text-sm text-brand-muted">01.03.2023</time>
      <h2 class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-brand-text">WalletCon 2023, Denver, CO – Panel on "Privacy and Convenience: Can you have it all?"</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-brand-body">Speakers: Zach Kwartler (Paxos), John Rising (Stackup), Zhen Yu Yong (Web3Auth). Moderation: Karolina Gorna (Ledger).</p>
      <iframe class="mt-4 aspect-video w-full max-w-2xl rounded-md" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/AJnnhRN11ZA" title="WalletCon 2023 – Privacy and Convenience" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen loading="lazy"></iframe>
    </article>

    <article class="border-b border-brand-border pb-8">
      <time class="text-sm text-brand-muted">22.09.2022</time>
      <h2 class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-brand-text">La blockchain peut-elle révolutionner la cybersécurité ? WIW3 Tech Talk avec Karolina Gorna</h2>
      <iframe class="mt-4 aspect-video w-full max-w-2xl rounded-md" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/9bP2YvaQnfo" title="WIW3 Tech Talk – Blockchain et cybersécurité" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen loading="lazy"></iframe>
      <iframe class="mt-3 w-full max-w-2xl rounded-xl" style="height:152px" src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/show/76hYBgrDApJfPv8zMHb1kQ" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen allow="autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" loading="lazy" title="WIW3 Tech Talk (Spotify)"></iframe>
    </article>

    <article class="border-b border-brand-border pb-8">
      <time class="text-sm text-brand-muted">28.06.2022</time>
      <h2 class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-brand-text">BFM BUSINESS – Entreprises: comment protéger vos cryptomonnaies ?</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-brand-body">A la suite de la parution de l'étude <a href="https://home.kpmg/fr/fr/home/insights/2022/06/cybersecurity-for-blockchains-and-cryptos-2022.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-band-fn-pure underline underline-offset-2">Cybersecurity for Blockchains and Cryptos 2022</a>, Alexandre Stachtchenko et Karolina Gorna sont intervenus sur le plateau de BFM Business pour expliquer les enjeux de la cybersécurité appliqués aux blockchains et aux cryptos.</p>
      <div class="mt-3">
        <a href="https://www.bfmtv.com/economie/entreprises-comment-proteger-vos-cryptomonnaies_VN-202206280644.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sm text-band-fn-pure underline underline-offset-2">BFM Business Interview</a>
      </div>
      <img src="/images/bfm1.png" alt="BFM Business interview" class="mt-3 max-w-2xl rounded-md border border-brand-border" loading="lazy" />
    </article>

    <article class="border-b border-brand-border pb-8">
      <time class="text-sm text-brand-muted">18.09.2021</time>
      <h2 class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-brand-text">International Colloquium on Emerging Technologies 2021</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-brand-body">Organizer: IEEE BVM SB. Role: Speaker on the topic "Blockchain and Self Sovereign Identity". This colloquium focuses on "Empowering Technophiles, Envisioning Tomorrow" because the future is uncertain and these technologies have the potential to change our entire future.</p>
      <img src="/images/international_colloquium_india.jpg" alt="International Colloquium on Emerging Technologies 2021" class="mt-3 max-w-2xl rounded-md border border-brand-border" loading="lazy" />
