    </article>

    <article class="border-b border-brand-border pb-8">
      <time class="text-sm text-brand-muted">12.06.2021</time>
      <h2 class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-brand-text">Panel: How Blockchain is Helping to Achieve Sustainable Development Goals?</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-brand-body">Climate, Environment and Circular Economy – Robin Klemens (Westphalian University), Si Chen (Open Source Strategies, Inc.), Karolina Gorna (KRYPTOSPHERE), Kamlesh Nagware (Snapper Future). Members of the Hyperledger Climate SIG discuss the opportunities for blockchain/DLT's to address the Sustainable Development Goals.</p>
      <iframe class="mt-4 aspect-video w-full max-w-2xl rounded-md" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/wYEkI7XfeBE" title="How Blockchain is Helping to Achieve SDGs" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen loading="lazy"></iframe>
    </article>

    <article class="border-b border-brand-border pb-8">
      <time class="text-sm text-brand-muted">10.03.2021</time>
      <h2 class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-brand-text">Live COINTRIBUNE</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-brand-body">Pour la première fois, mais pas la dernière, Coin Tribune est en live pour discuter crypto, Blockchain et vous faire gagner de nombreux cadeaux, avec des invités de marque: Kryptosphere, The Sandbox, Diabolo et SwissBorg.</p>
      <iframe class="mt-4 aspect-video w-full max-w-2xl rounded-md" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/DNC_6Pk7Qpc" title="Live COINTRIBUNE" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen loading="lazy"></iframe>
    </article>

    <article class="border-b border-brand-border pb-8">
      <time class="text-sm text-brand-muted">05.03.2021</time>
      <h2 class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-brand-text">PODCAST Kryptosphere#1 avec Karolina et Mathis</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-brand-body">KRYPTOSPHERE vous propose ce tout premier épisode des podcasts. Nous accueillons Karolina Gorna et Mathis Gontier Delaunay qui vont présenter l'association et leur vision de l'écosystème crypto. L'objectif de ces podcasts est de démocratiser l'univers de la blockchain et des crypto-monnaies en invitant des passionnés francophones.</p>
      <div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="https://creators.spotify.com/pod/profile/kryptosphere1/episodes/Podcast-Kryptosphere1-avec-Karolina-et-Mathis-eri800/a-a4qs74h" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sm text-band-fn-pure underline underline-offset-2">Spotify</a>
        <a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/fr/podcast/podcast-kryptosphere-1-avec-karolina-et-mathis/id1559174631?i=1000513621676" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sm text-band-fn-pure underline underline-offset-2">Apple Podcast</a>
      </div>
      <iframe class="mt-4 w-full max-w-2xl rounded-xl" style="height:175px" src="https://embed.podcasts.apple.com/fr/podcast/podcast-kryptosphere-1-avec-karolina-et-mathis/id1559174631?i=1000513621676" frameborder="0" sandbox="allow-forms allow-popups allow-same-origin allow-scripts allow-top-navigation-by-user-activation" allow="autoplay *; encrypted-media *; fullscreen *; clipboard-write" loading="lazy" title="PODCAST Kryptosphere#1 – Apple Podcasts"></iframe>
